     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Use the Progress Indicator to inform users about processes that do not have a specific duration or completion time, such as fetching data from a server or performing background tasks. If the process duration is known, consider using the Progress Bar component instead to provide more accurate progress indication. If the loading process is expected to take a long time, consider providing additional context or feedback to users to manage their expectations.",
